  "solution": {
    "text": "Lysine (amino acid) can be tested by ninhydrin as ninhydrin test is used for testing amino acids.<br />Furfural can be tested by 1-naphthol.<br />Isopropyl alcohol can be tested by Ceric ammonium nitrate which is a yellow reagent and on reaction with alcohol changes to red.<br />Vinyl benzene (Styrene) can be tested by <math><mtext>KMn</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> as styrene decolourises alk. <math><mtext>KMn</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> due to presence of unsaturation (double bond)."
  }
